  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "工程地質",
    "sub_ename": "ENGINEERING GEOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "本課程聚焦於工程地質與工址調查之相關考試能力的養成，內容包含地質材料、地質構造與地質圖、環境因素、工程地質在邊坡工程/隧道工程/水庫工程之應用、及工址調查。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on the development of ability to take engineering geology and site investigation work related exams.  Content include geological materials, geological structure and geological maps, environmental factors, application of engineering geology in Slope / Tunnel Project / reservoir engineering, and site Investigation.",
